@IlirAliu_ The challenge with such methods is usually not visuals but the physical accuracy of the sim

Unfortunately, tasks in such methods are usually carefully picked to suppress the effects of physics gap

Would love to see examples in unstable dynamic tasks involving contact modulation

Goals are more important than methods.

@GeneralistAI from day 0 we had the conviction that if you solved the most crippling problem facing robotics, the data problem, you could break away from the crutches of VLAs and world models to build what’s best for the robots.

